OL,3,GNEWSACommunity radio station celebrates
OL,4,A30th birthday
OL,5,
OL,6,FA community radio station in
OL,7,FNorthampton has celebrated 30 years of
OL,8,Fbeing on air with a party in the
OL,9,Fstudio.
OL,11,FInspiration FM, in Northampton,
OL,12,Flaunched on 18 November 1996 and was
OL,13,Ffounded by Northampton-born DJ Mark
OL,14,FDean.
OL,16,FThe community-led radio station, based
OL,17,Fin Sheep Street, has had partnerships
OL,18,Fwith a number of local organisations
OL,19,Fover the years, including the BBC and
OL,20,Fyouth group Free2Talk.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
