OL,3,GNEWSACommunity radio station celebrates
OL,4,A30th birthday
OL,5,
OL,6,FDean told BBC Radio Northampton's
OL,7,FAngelle Joseph: "We wanted to start a
OL,8,Fplatform where we could breed the next
OL,9,Ftype of talent coming through, because
OL,10,Fno organisation can continue without
OL,11,Fyoung talent coming through with new
OL,12,Fideas."
